#. gettext picks its catalogue up once, before any of this
#. window exists, so a new language has to wait for a restart.
#: src/ui/window.vala:141
msgid "The new language will be used the next time Awalé is started."
msgstr "La nuova lingua sarà usata al prossimo avvio di Awalé."

#: src/ui/window.vala:386
msgid "That house belongs to the computer."
msgstr "Quella buca appartiene al computer."

#: src/ui/window.vala:389
msgid "That house is empty."
msgstr "Quella buca è vuota."

#: src/ui/window.vala:392
msgid ""
"The computer has no seeds left, so you must play a house whose seeds reach "
"their row."
msgstr ""
"Il computer non ha più semi, quindi devi giocare una buca i cui semi "
"raggiungano la sua fila."

#: src/ui/window.vala:395
msgid ""
"That move would capture every seed the computer has left, which the rules do "
"not allow."
msgstr ""
"Quella mossa catturerebbe tutti i semi rimasti al computer, cosa che le "
"regole non permettono."

#: src/ui/window.vala:439 src/ui/window.vala:579
msgid "The computer is thinking…"
msgstr "Il computer sta pensando…"

#. / Said when the computer has chosen its move and is about to play
#. / it. %d is the computer's house, numbered 1 to 6 along its row.
#: src/ui/window.vala:454
#, c-format
msgid "The computer plays house %d."
msgstr "Il computer gioca la buca %d."

#: src/ui/window.vala:577
msgid "Your turn."
msgstr "Tocca a te."

#. / Learning mode hint. %d is the recommended house, 1 to 6.
#: src/ui/window.vala:677
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Play house %d: the computer is out of seeds and this feeds them, which the "
"rules require."
msgstr ""
"Gioca la buca %d: il computer è rimasto senza semi e questa mossa lo nutre, "
"come richiedono le regole."

#. / Learning mode hint given when the player's own row is
#. / nearly empty, which loses a game with no capture in it.
#. / %1$d is the recommended house, 1 to 6. %2$d is how many
#. / seeds are left in the player's row.
#: src/ui/window.vala:683
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Play house %1$d: your row is down to %2$d seed, and this move keeps the most "
"on your side."
msgid_plural ""
"Play house %1$d: your row is down to %2$d seeds, and this move keeps the "
"most on your side."
msgstr[0] ""
"Gioca la buca %1$d: nella tua fila è rimasto solo %2$d seme, e questa mossa "
"è quella che ne lascia di più dalla tua parte."
msgstr[1] ""
"Gioca la buca %1$d: nella tua fila sono rimasti solo %2$d semi, e questa "
"mossa è quella che ne lascia di più dalla tua parte."

#. / Learning mode hint. %d is the recommended house, 1 to 6.
#: src/ui/window.vala:688
#, c-format
msgid "Play house %d: it is your only legal move."
msgstr "Gioca la buca %d: è la tua unica mossa valida."

#. / Learning mode hint. %d is the recommended house, 1 to 6.
#: src/ui/window.vala:691
#, c-format
msgid "Play house %d: it leaves you the strongest position."
msgstr "Gioca la buca %d: ti lascia nella posizione migliore."

#. / Learning mode hint. %1$d is the recommended house, 1 to 6.
#. / %2$d is how many seeds it captures.
#: src/ui/window.vala:706
#, c-format
msgid "Play house %1$d: it captures %2$d seed."
msgid_plural "Play house %1$d: it captures %2$d seeds."
msgstr[0] "Gioca la buca %1$d: cattura %2$d seme."
msgstr[1] "Gioca la buca %1$d: cattura %2$d semi."

#. / Added to the hint above when the computer can capture straight
#. / back. %d is how many seeds it would take.
#: src/ui/window.vala:715 src/ui/window.vala:789
#, c-format
msgid "The computer takes %d seed back."
msgid_plural "The computer takes %d seeds back."
msgstr[0] "Il computer se ne riprende %d subito."
msgstr[1] "Il computer se ne riprende %d subito."

#. / Learning mode hint. %1$d is the recommended house and
#. / %2$d one of your own houses, both numbered 1 to 6.
#. / %3$d is how many seeds the capture would take.
#: src/ui/window.vala:735
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Play house %1$d: it avoids leaving your house %2$d open to a capture of %3$d "
"seed."
msgid_plural ""
"Play house %1$d: it avoids leaving your house %2$d open to a capture of %3$d "
"seeds."
msgstr[0] ""
"Gioca la buca %1$d: evita di lasciare la tua buca %2$d esposta a una cattura "
"di %3$d seme."
msgstr[1] ""
"Gioca la buca %1$d: evita di lasciare la tua buca %2$d esposta a una cattura "
"di %3$d semi."

#. / Learning mode hint when a capture would take several houses at
#. / once. %1$d is the recommended house, 1 to 6. %2$s is a list of
#. / the player's own houses, such as "4, 5". %3$d is how many seeds
#. / the capture would take from them altogether.
#: src/ui/window.vala:754
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Play house %1$d: it avoids leaving your houses %2$s open to a capture of "
"%3$d seed."
msgid_plural ""
"Play house %1$d: it avoids leaving your houses %2$s open to a capture of "
"%3$d seeds."
msgstr[0] ""
"Gioca la buca %1$d: evita di lasciare le tue buche %2$s esposte a una "
"cattura di %3$d seme."
msgstr[1] ""
"Gioca la buca %1$d: evita di lasciare le tue buche %2$s esposte a una "
"cattura di %3$d semi."

#. / Tooltip on a house that captures but is not the recommended
#. / move. %d is how many seeds it would capture.
#: src/ui/window.vala:776
#, c-format
msgid "This captures %d seed."
msgid_plural "This captures %d seeds."
msgstr[0] "Questa mossa prende %d seme."
msgstr[1] "Questa mossa prende %d semi."

#. / Tooltip on a house that leaves the computer no capture next
#. / move, but is still not the recommended move. Only the one
#. / move ahead is claimed, which is all that was looked at.
#: src/ui/window.vala:784
msgid "The computer cannot capture on its next move."
msgstr "Il computer non può catturare nulla alla mossa successiva."

#. / Closes the tooltip above. %d is the recommended house, 1 to 6.
#: src/ui/window.vala:797
#, c-format
msgid "House %d is worth more over the next few moves."
msgstr "La buca %d rende di più nelle mosse successive."

#. / Shown once the player has reached 25 seeds while the round
#. / is still being played. %1$d is their seeds, %2$d the computer's.
#: src/ui/window.vala:835
#, c-format
msgid "You have won, %1$d seeds to %2$d. You can still finish the round."
msgstr "Hai vinto, %1$d semi a %2$d. Puoi comunque finire la mano."

#. / Shown once the computer has reached 25 seeds while the round is
#. / still being played. %1$d is the computer's seeds, %2$d the player's.
#: src/ui/window.vala:839
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The computer has won, %1$d seeds to %2$d. You can still finish the round."
msgstr "Ha vinto il computer, %1$d semi a %2$d. Puoi comunque finire la mano."

#. / Final result. %d is the number of seeds each player collected.
#: src/ui/window.vala:850
#, c-format
msgid "A draw, %d seeds each."
msgstr "Pareggio, %d semi a testa."

#. / Final result. %1$d is the player's seeds, %2$d the computer's.
#: src/ui/window.vala:855
#, c-format
msgid "You win, %1$d seeds to %2$d."
msgstr "Vinci tu, %1$d semi a %2$d."

#. / Final result. %1$d is the computer's seeds, %2$d the player's.
#: src/ui/window.vala:858
#, c-format
msgid "The computer wins, %1$d seeds to %2$d."
msgstr "Vince il computer, %1$d semi a %2$d."

#: src/ui/window.vala:867
msgid ""
"The same position came up three times, so each player took the seeds in "
"their own row."
msgstr ""
"La stessa posizione si è ripetuta tre volte, quindi ogni giocatore ha "
"raccolto i semi della propria fila."

#: src/ui/window.vala:869
msgid ""
"A hundred moves went by without a capture, so each player took the seeds in "
"their own row."
msgstr ""
"Sono passate cento mosse senza catture, quindi ogni giocatore ha raccolto i "
"semi della propria fila."

#: src/ui/window.vala:872
msgid ""
"You could not feed the computer, so you took the seeds left on the board."
msgstr ""
"Non potevi nutrire il computer, quindi raccogli i semi rimasti sul tavoliere."

#: src/ui/window.vala:874
msgid ""
"The computer could not feed you, so it took the seeds left on the board."
msgstr ""
"Il computer non poteva nutrirti, quindi raccoglie i semi rimasti sul "
"tavoliere."

#: src/ui/window.vala:876
msgid "There was no legal move left to play."
msgstr "Non restava nessuna mossa valida."

#~ msgid "win"
#~ msgstr "vince"

#~ msgid "loss"
#~ msgstr "perde"

#~ msgid "Worth %s seeds."
#~ msgstr "Vale %s semi."
